{"id": "DegQ9xiIESl", "title": "Video by index.opensource", "description": "One seed number, a whole dungeon floor.\n\nBrogue CE starts with rock, places a room, then tries new rooms until their doors meet existing walls without overlap. In this example, 35 room-candidate attempts follow the first room; the recorded floor ends with 20 rooms. Extra doors make loops; five rounds of neighbor rules shape the lakes.\n\nA lake is accepted only if the floor stays connected. This floor has lava; the liquid varies with depth. The same seed reproduces the same dungeon within the same dungeon version.\n\nWe redrew game-generated map data, revealing the whole map and removing players, monsters and items. Process colors and labels were added for the explanation.\n\nWhich part would you explore: rooms, loops, or lakes?\n\n\uc2dc\ub4dc \ubc88\ud638 \ud558\ub098\ub85c \ub358\uc804 \ud55c \uce35\uc744 \ub9cc\ub4ed\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\nBrogue CE\ub294 \ubc14\uc704\uc5d0\uc11c \ubc29 \ud558\ub098\ub97c \ud30c\ub0b8 \ub4a4, \uacb9\uce58\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc73c\uba74\uc11c \ubb38\uc774 \uae30\uc874 \ubcbd\uc5d0 \ub2ff\ub294 \uc790\ub9ac\ub97c \ucc3e\uc544 \uc0c8 \ubc29\uc744 \ubd99\uc5ec\uc694. \uc774 \uc608\uc5d0\uc11c\ub294 \uccab \ubc29 \ub4a4\ub85c \ubc29 \ud6c4\ubcf4 \ubc30\uce58\ub97c 35\ubc88 \uc2dc\ub3c4\ud588\uace0, \uae30\ub85d\ub41c \uce35\uc5d0\ub294 \ubc29 20\uac1c\uac00 \ub0a8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ubb38\uc744 \ub354 \ub6ab\uc5b4 \ub3cc\uc544\uac00\ub294 \uae38\uc744 \ub9cc\ub4e4\uace0, \uc774\uc6c3 \uaddc\uce59\uc744 \ub2e4\uc12f \ubc88 \ub3cc\ub824 \ud638\uc218 \ubaa8\uc591\uc744 \ub2e4\ub4ec\uc5b4\uc694.\n\n\ud638\uc218\ub294 \ubc14\ub2e5\uc774 \uacc4\uc18d \uc5f0\uacb0\ub418\ub294 \uc790\ub9ac\uc5d0\ub9cc \ub193\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc774 \uce35\uc740 \uc6a9\uc554\uc774\uc9c0\ub9cc \uc561\uccb4\ub294 \uae4a\uc774\uc5d0 \ub530\ub77c \ub2ec\ub77c\uc838\uc694. \uac19\uc740 \ub358\uc804 \ubc84\uc804 \uc548\uc5d0\uc11c\ub294 \uac19\uc740 \uc2dc\ub4dc\uac00 \uac19\uc740 \ub358\uc804\uc744 \ub9cc\ub4ed\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\uac8c\uc784\uc774 \ub9cc\ub4e0 \uc9c0\ub3c4 \ub370\uc774\ud130\ub97c \ub2e4\uc2dc \uadf8\ub838\uace0, \uc804\uccb4 \uc9c0\ub3c4\ub97c \ub4dc\ub7ec\ub0b8 \ub4a4 \ud50c\ub808\uc774\uc5b4\u00b7\ubaac\uc2a4\ud130\u00b7\uc544\uc774\ud15c\uc744 \ube90\uc5b4\uc694. \uacfc\uc815\uc758 \uc0c9\uacfc \ub77c\ubca8\uc740 \uc124\uba85\uc744 \uc704\ud574 \ub354\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\ubc29, \uace0\ub9ac, \ud638\uc218 \uc911 \uc5b4\ub5a4 \uacfc\uc815\uc744 \ub354 \ubcf4\uace0 \uc2f6\uc73c\uc2e0\uac00\uc694?\n\nBrogue: Community Edition \u00b7 AGPL-3.0-or-later\nBrogue was created by Brian Walker; Community Edition continues its development.\nhttps://github.com/tmewett/BrogueCE\nCurated by @hyun2xyz", "channel": "index.opensource", "uploader_id": "60040254965", "uploader": "index.opensource", "timestamp": 1792044002, "like_count": 983, "comment_count": 3, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1041524242248594a", "manifest_url": null, "ext": "m4a", "width": null, "height": null, "tbr": 54.039, "asr": 48000, "fps": null, "language": null, "format_note": "DASH audio", "filesize": null, "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "dynamic_range": null, "url": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOfHMvUAD_PBTKRJUtJP85pvdpn4q6Bsi4GD4reWRDXuFd9okkZJVWlPENKhYYHpDUek6ALgPPDK0QADKsJF7DvINR9rbkvT4fXW0U.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=UfJUkgj1k6gQ7kNvwFZCeBU&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=423B4i8VXGKKZAzWoKMP9w&_nc_ss=79689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQP6QX2gKJH64IerRtE9Y24FrB1hmPqpL_H1Dx0YL7MrxA&oe=6AE20E5A", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "p